WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.303 --> 00:00:02.970
(hip hop music)

00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:05.770
- My ambition for the summer,

00:00:05.770 --> 00:00:08.773
is to create like I've never created.

00:00:08.773 --> 00:00:09.810
Yes!

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.270
To be the best partner to my partner

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:13.122
that I can be.

00:00:13.122 --> 00:00:14.480
(pop)

00:00:14.480 --> 00:00:16.150
To get dash money!

00:00:16.150 --> 00:00:18.550
- Darling, summer is
only three months long!

00:00:18.550 --> 00:00:20.064
- To longer summers!

00:00:20.064 --> 00:00:22.277
(hip hop music)

00:00:22.277 --> 00:00:24.210
I don't wanna just be known as a painter,

00:00:24.210 --> 00:00:25.660
I want to be multidisciplinary.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:27.950
Greer, in his natural habitat!

00:00:27.950 --> 00:00:29.310
- I bet that you never that you would see

00:00:29.310 --> 00:00:31.840
your "my name isn't" on
the side of a bus ad.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:33.440
- I do not want to be more famous

00:00:33.440 --> 00:00:35.790
for an ad than for my art.

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:37.354
- You're not feelin' it, huh?

00:00:37.354 --> 00:00:39.500
- I mean...

00:00:41.010 --> 00:00:43.240
No buildings blocking this
gorgeous heat and sun.

00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.670
- Skylar needs to know

00:00:44.670 --> 00:00:47.310
that she does not have two mommies.

00:00:47.310 --> 00:00:49.057
(squeals)

00:00:49.057 --> 00:00:50.483
- Nope, what'd I say about this?

00:00:50.483 --> 00:00:51.861
(clicks)

00:00:51.861 --> 00:00:53.653
I said stop!

00:00:53.653 --> 00:00:56.598
- This love shit is a motherfucker.

00:00:56.598 --> 00:00:59.181
(gentle music)

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:05.180
- I am the only one that
can see your real potential.

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:06.810
- There is nothing romantic

00:01:06.810 --> 00:01:09.009
about being a broke artist.

00:01:09.009 --> 00:01:11.069
(sighs)

00:01:11.069 --> 00:01:11.983
- I'm lost.

00:01:14.790 --> 00:01:16.790
- You're on a journey of your own!

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:17.690
- [Nola] Choosing.

00:01:20.420 --> 00:01:21.747
- May I take your picture, please?

00:01:21.747 --> 00:01:23.747
(click)

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:27.800
- I really got a thing for you.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.600
- You need to take off your Jordans.

00:01:35.150 --> 00:01:36.930
- Get back to your art, Nola.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.880
- I got work to do.

00:01:40.710 --> 00:01:43.310
I promise to do the best I can,

00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.403
be the best I can.

00:01:45.740 --> 00:01:48.393
With love, Nola Darling.

00:01:50.580 --> 00:01:53.830
(off-pitch vocalizing)

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.513
Shut the fuck up!

00:01:57.513 --> 00:02:02.513
♪ I gave you all my life ♪

